- Now whether you're on the
side of Katy Perry or Flame,

00:23:50.340 --> 00:23:52.910
you can see how both of them
used similar building blocks

00:23:52.910 --> 00:23:56.110
to make their world famous
songs, because making music

00:23:56.110 --> 00:23:58.830
